# Architecture

## Server Layers (top → bottom)
1. `server/main.js` — process entry, HTTP/Socket.io bootstrap
2. `server/api/` — Express routers; MUST delegate to `runtime/`
3. `server/runtime/` — devices, storage, alarms, scripts, sockets
4. `server/integrations/` — Node-RED nodes; MUST call runtime APIs only

## Allowed Import Directions (Server)
- `api/` → `runtime/`, `api/jwt-helper.js` ✅
- `runtime/` → `api/` ❌ NEVER (use `init()` injection instead)
- `runtime/devices/*` → sibling `datatypes.js`, `runtime/utils.js` ✅
- `integrations/` → `runtime/` ✅; direct device protocol libs ❌

## Client Layers (`client/src/app/`)
| Folder | Role |
|--------|------|
| `_models/` | Plain TypeScript interfaces/types |
| `_services/` | HTTP/Socket.io data access |
| `_helpers/` | Stateless utilities |
| `gauges/`, `editor/`, `device/` | Feature UI components |
| `framework/`, `gui-helpers/` | Shared reusable widgets |

## Allowed Import Directions (Client)
- Components → `_services/`, `_models/`, `_helpers/` ✅
- `_services/` → `_models/`, `_helpers/`, `environments/` ✅
- `_models/` → other `_models/` only ✅
- Components → direct `HttpClient` or `socket.io-client` ❌ NEVER

## Where New Code Belongs
- REST endpoint → `server/api/<domain>/index.js`
- Device protocol driver → `server/runtime/devices/<protocol>/`
- DAQ/storage backend → `server/runtime/storage/<engine>/`
- UI feature screen → `client/src/app/<feature>/`
- Shared Angular widget → `client/src/app/framework/` or `gui-helpers/`
